            <ArticleTitle>JNC 8: what's covered, what's not, and what else to consider.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>574-84</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>JNC 8 guidelines offer greater discretion in drug choice and modest relaxation of some BP targets. This review summarizes the recommendations and provides guidance on 2 patient populations that aren't addressed.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
